        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Tropicana Products, PepsiCo, Pepsi-Cola company, Tip Corporation\n- Products: Mountain Dew\n- Places: United States, Canada\n\nFacts:\n- In August 1964, the Pepsi-Cola company acquired the Mountain Dew brand and production rights from Tip Corporation.\n- After the August 1964 acquisition, the Pepsi-Cola company expanded Mountain Dew distribution across the United States and Canada.\n- Since 1998, PepsiCo has owned Tropicana Products.",
